@startuml deployment_desktop
!pragma layout smetana
title Interactive development without the Pi
node "Development host (Docker)" {
  component "Browser" as Browser
  artifact "Repository sources (read-only mount)" as Sources
  artifact "build/hmi-container/<platform> (writable)" as Build
  node "Debian Bookworm container" {
    component "noVNC + websockify :6080" as Web
    component "x11vnc 127.0.0.1:5900" as VNC
    component "Xvfb :1 + Openbox" as X11
    component "Tk kspsim test app" as Sim
    component "Actual C++ HMI / SDL X11" as HMI
  }
}
Browser <--> Web : host loopback :6080\nHTTP / WebSocket
Web <--> VNC : container loopback\nVNC protocol
VNC <--> X11 : pixels / user input
Sim --> X11 : GUI window
HMI --> X11 : GUI window
HMI <--> Sim : container loopback\nTCP 50300/50301 + UDP 50002
Sources --> HMI : copied sources / CMake build
Sources --> Sim : Python tools
HMI --> Build : binaries / logs / artifacts
Sim --> Build : logs / smoke result
note bottom of Sim : Arduino disabled (--no-board).\nNo Unity process or real KSP required.
@enduml
